SUMMARY:Ancestors: The Humankind Odyssey (Nintendo Switch 2\, PlayStation 5
 \, Xbox Series X|S)
DESCRIPTION:Developer: Panache Digital Games\n\nPublisher: Fictions\, Priva
 te Division\n\nAncestors: The Humankind Odyssey is a single-player surviva
 l game played from a third-person view and set in an open world. Players c
 ontrol a member of a hominid clan and manage its needs by eating\, drinkin
 g\, and sleeping while facing predators and other dangers in the wild. Exp
 loring new places and being hunted can trigger a state of fear\, which is 
 offset by rewarding actions such as crafting tools and making discoveries.
  As the clan learns and grows\, players unlock new skills through a neural
  development system and can switch between clan members\, passing acquired
  abilities to future generations. The game has no structured narrative cam
 paign and instead lets players shape their own experience.\n\nhttps://www.
 igdb.com/games/ancestors-the-humankind-odyssey
