SUMMARY:Silver Palace (PC (Microsoft Windows)\, PlayStation 5)
DESCRIPTION:Publisher: Elementa\n\nSilver Palace is an upcoming open‑world 
 detective action‑adventure RPG developed by Silver Studio and published by
  Elementa worldwide. It is set in the sprawling Victorian‑style metropolis
  of Sylvanea\, built upon the revolutionary element known as Silver Liquid
  that has fueled its industrial and social transformation. Players assume 
 the role of a detective tasked with unraveling complex criminal conspiraci
 es and uncovering hidden truths scattered throughout the city. The game se
 amlessly blends open‑world exploration with dynamic real‑time combat\, fea
 turing character switching\, skill combos\, and QTE‑style finishers. Trave
 rsal options include horseback riding\, aerial wire‑grappling\, and free‑r
 unning across richly detailed environments. Silver Palace is built on Unre
 al Engine 5\, delivering high‑fidelity anime‑inspired visuals and cinemati
 c battle sequences. It will be available on PC\, major consoles\, iOS\, an
 d Android devices with pre‑registration now open for global audiences. The
  title adopts a free‑to‑play model enhanced by gacha mechanics for charact
 er and gear progression. An 11‑minute gameplay showcase has been released\
 , offering a deep dive into the game’s mechanics and world‑building. No fi
 rm release date has been announced\, but further details and developer upd
 ates will be shared via the official website and social channels.\n\nhttps
 ://www.igdb.com/games/silver-palace
END:VEVENT
